  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Strengthening Institutional Capacity of the DNPWC for the Effective Management of Mountain Protected Areas</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Capacity building and Institutional Strengthening of the Department of National Parks and Wildlife Conservation to effectively manage mountainous protected areas, with an emphasis on conservation of flagship species. The objective of the proposed IDF grant is to strengthen the institutional capacity of the Department of National Parks and Wildlife Conservation (DNPWC) under the Ministry of Forests and Soil Conservation (MoFSC) to facilitate the effective management of Protected Areas (PAs) in the mountain regions with an aim to stabilize and, if possible, increase the population and habitats of critically endangered wildlife in Nepal&apos;s threatened mountain ecosystems.</narrative>
  </description>
